{"parse": {"title": "小狗与流浪汉-07", "pageid": 89614, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%B0%8F%E7%8B%97%E4%B8%8E%E6%B5%81%E6%B5%AA%E6%B1%89-06\" title=\"小狗与流浪汉-06\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">小狗与流浪汉-07</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%B0%8F%E7%8B%97%E4%B8%8E%E6%B5%81%E6%B5%AA%E6%B1%89-08\" title=\"小狗与流浪汉-08\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">小狗与流浪汉</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">07</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E5.9B.9E.E5.BC.B9.E7.90.83\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"回弹球\">回弹球</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 回弹球</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Bouncy Ball</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-youlunjiaban_ye.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"youlunjiaban_ye\"><img alt=\"youlunjiaban_ye\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/Cg-youlunjiaban_ye.png/600px-Cg-youlunjiaban_ye.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/Cg-youlunjiaban_ye.png/900px-Cg-youlunjiaban_ye.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/Cg-youlunjiaban_ye.png/1200px-Cg-youlunjiaban_ye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>狺狺。<i>&lt;我想这是正确的道路。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>小小的脑袋自告别的人群中探出了头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>狺，狺狺狺？<i>&lt;噢，这是海风吗？&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>黑白色的长毛随着吹来的海风轻柔地舞动着，靛青色的微光自毛发末端缓缓淡去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>小狗眯起了眼睛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>呜……<i>&lt;呼……&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>狺狺。<i>&lt;这可能是今天最清爽的一瞬间了。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>狺狺狺。<i>&lt;但很可惜现在不是享受的时候。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>狺狺？<i>&lt;查尔顿还在附近吗？&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>狺……<i>&lt;希望他没有离开……&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>小狗向船下望去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>……？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>呜？<i>&lt;升锚艇？&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-505601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-505601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-505601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">游客I：</div><div>嗯？这儿有只小狗！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"502401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-502401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-502401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"502401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-502401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-502401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-502401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-502401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">游客II：</div><div>和汽水罐子上的这只好像！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>狺狺。<i>&lt;我或许应该先下船。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪，汪汪——<i>&lt;哦，来不及了——&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"611212.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a5/HeadIconSmall-611212.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-611212.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"611212.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a5/HeadIconSmall-611212.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-611212.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a5/HeadIconSmall-611212.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-611212.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>皮——斯——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>皮克勒斯的耳朵轻轻动了动。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪？<i>&lt;查尔顿？&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>小狗抬起头，向岸边看去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>查尔顿拨开人群，向停靠的游轮努力地前进着。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-hegang_ye.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"hegang_ye\"><img alt=\"hegang_ye\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/Cg-hegang_ye.png/600px-Cg-hegang_ye.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/Cg-hegang_ye.png/900px-Cg-hegang_ye.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/Cg-hegang_ye.png/1200px-Cg-hegang_ye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2d/HeadIconSmall-505901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2d/HeadIconSmall-505901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2d/HeadIconSmall-505901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">工作人员：</div><div>嘿，先生，我们的舷梯要收起来了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">查尔顿：</div><div>我有票！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>男人提着行李，试图突破检票员的阻拦。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2d/HeadIconSmall-505901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2d/HeadIconSmall-505901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2d/HeadIconSmall-505901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">工作人员：</div><div>先生，这很危险！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c1/HeadIconSmall-306301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c1/HeadIconSmall-306301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c1/HeadIconSmall-306301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪——！<i>&lt;查尔顿！&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c1/HeadIconSmall-306301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c1/HeadIconSmall-306301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c1/HeadIconSmall-306301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪汪。汪，汪呜……？<i>&lt;他刚刚看到我了。不敢置信，人类的视觉也这样好吗？&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">查尔顿：</div><div>皮克勒斯，这次你千万不要动！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>查尔顿满脸惊慌。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>舷梯发出了刺耳的响声。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2d/HeadIconSmall-505901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2d/HeadIconSmall-505901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2d/HeadIconSmall-505901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">工作人员：</div><div>先生，您冷静些，在岸边太危险了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">温迪：</div><div>獒，汪汪！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>男人挣脱工作人员。他抬头望着自船上努力探出头来的小狗，又低头看了看深色的海面。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>舷梯划着半圆，缓缓向他的方向靠近。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">查尔顿：</div><div>呼——管不了这么多了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他下定决心似地攥紧了手中的破旧皮袋，深吸了一口气。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">查尔顿：</div><div>温迪，跳！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>作为一只斗牛犬，它弹跳力惊人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"611301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f7/HeadIconSmall-611301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-611301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"611301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f7/HeadIconSmall-611301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-611301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f7/HeadIconSmall-611301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-611301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">温迪：</div><div>汪汪！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>它的后爪稳稳落地。查尔顿猛地蹬了下岸边的防护桩。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c1/HeadIconSmall-306301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c1/HeadIconSmall-306301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c1/HeadIconSmall-306301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪，汪汪！<i>&lt;当心，查尔顿！&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"611212.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a5/HeadIconSmall-611212.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-611212.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"611212.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a5/HeadIconSmall-611212.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-611212.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a5/HeadIconSmall-611212.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-611212.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">查尔顿：</div><div>喔喔……！！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他的腿打着颤，脚下的舷梯发出了刺耳的噪音。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"611212.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a5/HeadIconSmall-611212.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-611212.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"611212.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a5/HeadIconSmall-611212.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-611212.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a5/HeadIconSmall-611212.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-611212.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">查尔顿：</div><div>它在颤抖——！！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2d/HeadIconSmall-505901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2d/HeadIconSmall-505901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2d/HeadIconSmall-505901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">工作人员：</div><div>不！先生——停下，先停下舷梯！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"611310.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-611310.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-611310.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"611310.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-611310.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-611310.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-611310.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-611310.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">温迪：</div><div>汪，汪汪！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>小斗牛犬也跟着摇摇晃晃。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"611212.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a5/HeadIconSmall-611212.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-611212.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"611212.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a5/HeadIconSmall-611212.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-611212.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a5/HeadIconSmall-611212.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-611212.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">查尔顿：</div><div>好的，好的！我站稳了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"611201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-611201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-611201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"611201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-611201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-611201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-611201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-611201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">查尔顿：</div><div>温迪，一鼓作气……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>查尔顿向船上扔出了红色的回弹球。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"611201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-611201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-611201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"611201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-611201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-611201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-611201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-611201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">查尔顿：</div><div>跑——！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-youlunjiaban_ye.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"youlunjiaban_ye\"><img alt=\"youlunjiaban_ye\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/Cg-youlunjiaban_ye.png/600px-Cg-youlunjiaban_ye.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/Cg-youlunjiaban_ye.png/900px-Cg-youlunjiaban_ye.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/Cg-youlunjiaban_ye.png/1200px-Cg-youlunjiaban_ye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">查尔顿：</div><div>小皮克勒斯——我的皮克勒斯！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>冲上游轮的男人一把搂住了来舷梯旁迎接的小狗。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">温迪：</div><div>汪，汪汪！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c1/HeadIconSmall-306301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c1/HeadIconSmall-306301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c1/HeadIconSmall-306301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪汪。<i>&lt;温迪，你捡到它了。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>小斗牛犬放下嘴里的回弹球，拱了拱气喘吁吁的查尔顿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">查尔顿：</div><div>都怪我，光顾着那些蠢行李……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪汪，呜？汪汪，吽。<i>&lt;查尔顿，你还好吗？你心跳过快，需要深呼吸。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪汪汪……<i>&lt;现在应该不是谈话的好时候……&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪呜……<i>&lt;你应该先休息片刻再……&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">查尔顿：</div><div>我不应该勉强你参加活动的，但我以为你会喜欢……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪汪，汪。<i>&lt;我确实不太喜欢过于喧闹的场合与陌生的人群。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪嗯。<i>&lt;也对配方罐头和代言不感兴趣。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"615901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-615901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-615901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"615901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-615901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-615901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-615901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-615901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">\"Doggie\"：</div><div>小狗不喜欢热闹。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">查尔顿：</div><div>啊……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>男人显得无比失落。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪汪汪，汪呜。<i>&lt;但你同样为我回绝了很多其他的代言，尽管我觉得你并不能理解我的想法。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>呜……<i>&lt;哦，或许……&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>小狗的脑海中出现了一只苹果。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪汪汪，嗯……<i>&lt;或许苹果先生说得对，理解并不是我们相处之间最必须的……&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"615901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-615901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-615901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"615901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-615901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-615901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-615901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-615901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">\"Doggie\"：</div><div>小狗&amp;#@%……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">查尔顿：</div><div>嗯？这个翻译机坏了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪，汪呜。<i>&lt;查尔顿，尽管你不擅长对于矛盾深入地思考与剖析。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪汪汪，嗯。<i>&lt;但我承认在与朋友的相处方面，你有着优秀的直觉。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪汪。<i>&lt;我需要向你学习。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"615901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-615901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-615901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"615901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-615901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-615901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-615901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-615901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">\"Doggie\"：</div><div>小狗想要一个拥抱。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪？！汪汪，汪……<i>&lt;拥抱？！不，我没——&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">查尔顿：</div><div>哦，我的天，它真的坏了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪……汪汪。<i>&lt;虽然……但我认为我平日里并不冷漠。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">查尔顿：</div><div>不过也许你真的吓坏了，小家伙……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>查尔顿一把抱住小狗，狠狠地搓了搓他的后颈。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">查尔顿：</div><div>好的，没事了兄弟，我们又在一块儿了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪……<i>&lt;嗯……&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪汪汪，汪，汪呜？<i>&lt;我们仍能在不理解中获得彼此的尊重，这是一件好事，不是吗？&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“呜——”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪，汪汪。&lt;哦，糟糕，船启航了。&gt;</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪……汪汪汪？<i>&lt;或许……这有可能是去往希腊的那艘吗？&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">查尔顿：</div><div>幸运的是，我们还是赶上了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>……汪，呜。<i>&lt;……哦，好吧。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">查尔顿：</div><div>这点我该向你道歉，我没想到你会抵触到想要离家出走。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">查尔顿：</div><div>不过你放心……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">查尔顿：</div><div>我会试着弥补的，向他们提出取消见面会……我想主办方那边应该不会……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-lvguan.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"lvguan\"><img alt=\"lvguan\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/Cg-lvguan.png/600px-Cg-lvguan.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/Cg-lvguan.png/900px-Cg-lvguan.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/Cg-lvguan.png/1200px-Cg-lvguan.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2d/HeadIconSmall-505901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2d/HeadIconSmall-505901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2d/HeadIconSmall-505901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">工作人员：</div><div>这绝不可能，查尔顿先生。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"611211.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-611211.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-611211.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"611211.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-611211.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-611211.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-611211.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-611211.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">查尔顿：</div><div>哦……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"611211.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-611211.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-611211.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"611211.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-611211.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-611211.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-611211.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-611211.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">查尔顿：</div><div>呃……这和想象里的可不太一样啊，哈哈。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-youlunjiaban_ye.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"youlunjiaban_ye\"><img alt=\"youlunjiaban_ye\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/Cg-youlunjiaban_ye.png/600px-Cg-youlunjiaban_ye.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/Cg-youlunjiaban_ye.png/900px-Cg-youlunjiaban_ye.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/Cg-youlunjiaban_ye.png/1200px-Cg-youlunjiaban_ye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>狺狺。<i>&lt;这其实不在我的意料之外。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2d/HeadIconSmall-505901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2d/HeadIconSmall-505901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2d/HeadIconSmall-505901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">工作人员：</div><div>临时取消活动是非常不负责任的行为，我希望您能明白。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪汪汪，呜，汪汪……<i>&lt;没关系的，查尔顿，只是一场见面会的话……&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2d/HeadIconSmall-505901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2d/HeadIconSmall-505901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2d/HeadIconSmall-505901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">工作人员：</div><div>我们已经为这场见面会做了最大准备，甚至为此在游轮上准备了预热场。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"611211.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-611211.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-611211.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"611211.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-611211.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-611211.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-611211.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-611211.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">查尔顿：</div><div>今天就……？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2d/HeadIconSmall-505901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2d/HeadIconSmall-505901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2d/HeadIconSmall-505901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">工作人员：</div><div>是的……我们本想早些与您进行沟通，但我的同事联系不上您。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"611211.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-611211.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-611211.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"611211.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-611211.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-611211.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-611211.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-611211.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">查尔顿：</div><div>呃，今天，出了点意外……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"611211.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-611211.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-611211.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"611211.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-611211.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-611211.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-611211.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-611211.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">查尔顿：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>男人尴尬地挠了挠后脑勺。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"611211.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-611211.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-611211.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"611211.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-611211.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-611211.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-611211.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-611211.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">查尔顿：</div><div>真的，一点可能性都没有了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2d/HeadIconSmall-505901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2d/HeadIconSmall-505901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2d/HeadIconSmall-505901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">工作人员：</div><div>绝无可能。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2d/HeadIconSmall-505901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2d/HeadIconSmall-505901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2d/HeadIconSmall-505901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">工作人员：</div><div>但如果您执意要这么做的话……很遗憾，那样您或许将承担基于演出经费计算的十倍违约赔偿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"611211.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-611211.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-611211.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"611211.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-611211.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-611211.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-611211.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-611211.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">查尔顿：</div><div>十倍？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"611211.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-611211.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-611211.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"611211.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-611211.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-611211.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-611211.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-611211.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">查尔顿：</div><div>这也……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>狺狺。<i>&lt;今天发生的突发事件的概率过于高了。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>狺，狺狺狺……<i>&lt;先是奇特的哲学交流会，然后是那个制造肥皂泡的怪男人……&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>……呜。<i>&lt;……等等。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>小狗站起身。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪，汪汪汪。<i>&lt;我有个不太恰当，但或许十分有效的办法。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"615901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-615901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-615901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"615901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-615901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-615901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-615901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-615901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">\"Doggie\"：</div><div>小狗有了新的想法。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"611211.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-611211.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-611211.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"611211.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-611211.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-611211.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-611211.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-611211.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">查尔顿：</div><div>皮克勒斯？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>黑白相间的牧羊犬头也不回地冲出了门。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"611211.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-611211.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-611211.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"611211.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-611211.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-611211.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-611211.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-611211.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">查尔顿：</div><div>小皮克勒斯！</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "小狗与流浪汉-07"}}